    "{Avatud} and {suletud} are what a sign says. Talking, people say {lahti} and {kinni}: {Uks on kinni}.": "{Avatud} и {suletud} пишут на табличках. В разговоре говорят {lahti} и {kinni}: {Uks on kinni}.",
